---
import ProductLayout from '../../../layouts/ProductLayout.astro';
---

<ProductLayout
  productName="Bantay Mail"
  productSlug="bantay-mail"
  pageTitle="Support"
  description="Support information for Bantay Mail deployments, administrators, and users."
  canonicalPath="/products/bantay-mail/support/"
  active="support"
>
  <h2>Get help with Bantay Mail</h2>
  <p>
    For general product support, email <a href="mailto:hello@kitechsoftware.com?subject=Bantay%20Mail%20support">hello@kitechsoftware.com</a>. Include the Bantay Mail version, operating environment, deployment method, and a concise description of the issue.
  </p>

  <h2>Mailbox and login issues</h2>
  <p>
    Contact the administrator of your Bantay Mail deployment first. The administrator normally controls mailbox creation, passwords, authentication, aliases, quotas, forwarding, retention, backups, and access policy. KiTech Software may not have access to the deployment or its accounts.
  </p>

  <h2>Information to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>the product and component version;</li>
    <li>the operating system or container environment;</li>
    <li>the affected protocol or component, such as SMTP, IMAP, directory, authentication, or administration;</li>
    <li>the time of the problem and relevant non-sensitive error messages; and</li>
    <li>steps already taken to diagnose the issue.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Remove passwords, tokens, private keys, mailbox content, personal information, and unrelated log entries before sending diagnostic material.
  </p>

  <h2>Security vulnerabilities</h2>
  <p>
    Do not publish suspected vulnerabilities or active exploit details in a public issue. Follow the <a href="/legal/responsible-disclosure/">Responsible Disclosure Policy</a> and the contact details on the <a href="/security/">Security page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Useful links</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/products/bantay-mail/privacy/">Bantay Mail Privacy Notice</a></li>
    <li><a href="/products/bantay-mail/delete-account/">Delete a mailbox or account</a></li>
    <li><a href="/privacy/choices/">Request deletion of specific data or exercise other privacy rights (without closing your account)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/legal/data-retention/">Data Retention Policy</a></li>
  </ul>
</ProductLayout>
